{"title": "Tenacity (passive feature)", "pageid": 30315, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Tenacity_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">For the reaction, see <a href=\"/wiki/Tenacity\" title=\"Tenacity\">Tenacity</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tenacity.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Tenacity.webp/300px-Tenacity.webp, /w/images/b/bd/Tenacity.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Tenacity.webp/300px-Tenacity.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/Tenacity.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Tenacity</b> is a feature that allows the user to apply damage, even on a miss.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you miss a melee attack, you deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\"><a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Modifier\">Modifier</a></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a> damage (minimum of 1) anyway. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Adrielle\" title=\"Adrielle\">Adrielle</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Air_Myrmidon\" title=\"Air Myrmidon\">Air Myrmidon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Apostate_Destroyer\" title=\"Apostate Destroyer\">Apostate Destroyer</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bao%27ek%27nuk\" title=\"Bao'ek'nuk\">Bao'ek'nuk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Blasphemous_Acolyte\" title=\"Blasphemous Acolyte\">Blasphemous Acolyte</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Brammels\" title=\"Brammels\">Brammels</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bugbear\" title=\"Bugbear\">Bugbear</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bugbear_Assassin\" title=\"Bugbear Assassin\">Bugbear Assassin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Buthir\" title=\"Buthir\">Buthir</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ca%C3%AFros\" title=\"Caïros\">Caïros</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Callie\" title=\"Callie\">Callie</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Chock\" title=\"Chock\">Chock</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cragbender\" title=\"Cragbender\">Cragbender</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Duckie_Verish\" title=\"Duckie Verish\">Duckie Verish</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dugg\" title=\"Dugg\">Dugg</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Sendai\" title=\"Echo of Sendai\">Echo of Sendai</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Edvidge\" title=\"Edvidge\">Edvidge</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Faril\" title=\"Faril\">Faril</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Forstum\" title=\"Forstum\">Forstum</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Giant_Skeleton\" title=\"Giant Skeleton\">Giant Skeleton</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gilded_Minotaur\" title=\"Gilded Minotaur\">Gilded Minotaur</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gleeful_Clong\" title=\"Gleeful Clong\">Gleeful Clong</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Glourik\" title=\"Glourik\">Glourik</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Grukkoh\" title=\"Grukkoh\">Grukkoh</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gurgon\" title=\"Gurgon\">Gurgon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hairy_Henry\" title=\"Hairy Henry\">Hairy Henry</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Haseid\" title=\"Haseid\">Haseid</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hellrider_Paladin\" title=\"Hellrider Paladin\">Hellrider Paladin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Humgoole\" title=\"Humgoole\">Humgoole</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Imprudence\" title=\"Imprudence\">Imprudence</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ironfinger\" title=\"Ironfinger\">Ironfinger</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jezzy_Topps\" title=\"Jezzy Topps\">Jezzy Topps</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Karol\" title=\"Karol\">Karol</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kressa_Bonedaughter\" title=\"Kressa Bonedaughter\">Kressa Bonedaughter</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lann_Tarv\" title=\"Lann Tarv\">Lann Tarv</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lump\" title=\"Lump\">Lump</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Maghtew_Budj\" title=\"Maghtew Budj\">Maghtew Budj</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Marcus_Falgor\" title=\"Marcus Falgor\">Marcus Falgor</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mig\" title=\"Mig\">Mig</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mofty\" title=\"Mofty\">Mofty</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nickelow\" title=\"Nickelow\">Nickelow</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Polma\" title=\"Polma\">Polma</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Radija\" title=\"Radija\">Radija</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rath\" title=\"Rath\">Rath</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sarabayle\" title=\"Sarabayle\">Sarabayle</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Scrawny_Bugbear\" title=\"Scrawny Bugbear\">Scrawny Bugbear</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shiv_Dahlia\" title=\"Shiv Dahlia\">Shiv Dahlia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Stimk\" title=\"Stimk\">Stimk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Susdera\" title=\"Susdera\">Susdera</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Taslim\" title=\"Taslim\">Taslim</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Teghun\" title=\"Teghun\">Teghun</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Thudd\" title=\"Thudd\">Thudd</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Vikki\" title=\"Vikki\">Vikki</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Willinx_Jindlebee\" title=\"Willinx Jindlebee\">Willinx Jindlebee</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wren\" title=\"Wren\">Wren</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Yafeu\" title=\"Yafeu\">Yafeu</a></li></ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p><p>Available on all <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Greatclubs\" title=\"Greatclubs\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Greatclubs_Icon.png/25px-Greatclubs_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Greatclubs_Icon.png/38px-Greatclubs_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Greatclubs_Icon.png/50px-Greatclubs_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Greatclubs\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Greatclubs_Icon.png/25px-Greatclubs_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a8/Greatclubs_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Greatclubs\" title=\"Greatclubs\">Greatclubs</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flails\" title=\"Flails\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Flails_Icon.png/25px-Flails_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Flails_Icon.png/38px-Flails_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Flails_Icon.png/50px-Flails_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flails\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Flails_Icon.png/25px-Flails_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Flails_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flails\" title=\"Flails\">Flails</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Morningstars\" title=\"Morningstars\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Morningstars_Icon.png/25px-Morningstars_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Morningstars_Icon.png/38px-Morningstars_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Morningstars_Icon.png/50px-Morningstars_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Morningstars\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Morningstars_Icon.png/25px-Morningstars_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Morningstars_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Morningstars\" title=\"Morningstars\">Morningstars</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mauls\" title=\"Mauls\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Mauls_Icon.png/25px-Mauls_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Mauls_Icon.png/38px-Mauls_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Mauls_Icon.png/50px-Mauls_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mauls\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Mauls_Icon.png/25px-Mauls_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d2/Mauls_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mauls\" title=\"Mauls\">Mauls</a>.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<p>Grants:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tenacity\" title=\"Tenacity\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Tenacity_Icon.webp/40px-Tenacity_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Tenacity_Icon.webp/60px-Tenacity_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Tenacity_Icon.webp/80px-Tenacity_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tenacity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Tenacity_Icon.webp/40px-Tenacity_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Tenacity_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tenacity\" title=\"Tenacity\">Tenacity</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Upon missing a melee attack, still deals <a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\">bludgeoning</a> damage equal to <a href=\"/wiki/STR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"STR\">STR</a> modifier or a minimum of 1.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201040\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1670/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13136/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5523/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3461/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 830935/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   47.582      1 -total\n 99.13%   47.169      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 33.51%   15.946      6 Template:Icon_link\n 32.22%   15.331      6 Template:Icon_text\n 27.56%   13.114     17 Template:Trim\n 21.67%   10.309      1 Template:Passive_creatures_list\n 21.51%   10.234      1 Template:DamageText\n 19.11%    9.092      1 Template:Damage_type\n 17.51%    8.331      6 Template:Ifempty\n 13.01%    6.192      4 Template:WeaponType\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30315-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201040 and revision id 375